285
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,400
How many people consumes on this basis?

286
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:10,280
How many?

287
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:12,400
You do?

288
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:16,040
Why would economists not be rational?

