304
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:54,800
All people are equally attractive.

305
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:55,300
What?

306
00:10:57,300 --> 00:10:58,880
Because there's somebody for everyone,

307
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,480
