308
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,440
It doesn't.

309
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:04,120
But anyway, so when I talk to economists

310
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,520
with very different views, then they're like, duh.

311
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:08,200
Of course it's ridiculous.

312
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,880
So we can have a conversation about 1,000 things

313
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,400
we agree are ridiculous that normal people would believe.

314
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,440
So that is my big story.

315
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,360
Oh, yeah, Sonia does this slightly distracted.

316
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:25,080
So it's very common for voters to respond

