322
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:38,040
It doesn't matter what the bananas cost.

323
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:41,800
Bananas from like potassium, they

324
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:45,360
are important to a childhood.

325
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,880
All right, no thanks.

326
00:11:46,880 --> 00:11:49,520
So when you're spending your own money, cost always matters.

327
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:51,960
But somehow when voters are spending taxpayer money,

328
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,920
that cost does not matter.

329
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,480
And why do people say that?

330
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,080
Even it sounds really good to say it doesn't matter.

331
00:11:58,080 --> 00:12:01,400
It is like believing that when you die,

