381
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,260
It could have labeled you an enemy.

382
00:13:59,260 --> 00:13:59,800
Yes.

383
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,440
In fact, if anything, you're actually

384
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,800
