385
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,280
Maybe you'll be found out.

386
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:07,480
But the key thing is that everyone in Germany

387
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:11,560
went and suffered because he won that election.

