392
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:22,360
I think that we get the government they deserve.

393
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,800
Very different.

394
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:26,200
We deserve great government.

395
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:28,320
But we don't get it.

396
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:30,880
And again, it's the same logic of just

397
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:33,800
like all voters can be better off if they all polluted less,

398
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:36,800
all voters can be better off if they were more rational,

