00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:42,120
And yet if one person unilaterally changes,

401
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,680
what happens?

402
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:45,840
They are inconvenienced or burdened

403
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,920
or they don't get the psychological enjoyment,

404
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:50,560
but the outcome doesn't change.

405
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,840
So you think about, say, protectionism.

