00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,600
But anyway, whatever the technology is,

514
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,140
when you read the stories, it's going

515
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:45,120
to be people arguing about stupid stuff

516
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:48,000
with ridiculous arguments.

517
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,640
Right?

518
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,960
So 50 years, there'll probably still

519
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,800
be hungry children in the world, but people

520
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:57,280
arguing about someone being offensive to it.

521
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:58,920
That's what people want to argue about.

522
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,760
That's what you think is important.

523
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,600
This is the way you think you acquire truth,

524
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:05,760
is by getting angry at people for offending you.

525
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:12,840
So what I say is Whitman's right that the main public choice

526
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:15,600
arguments assume extreme voter stupidity.

527
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:17,560
But that's fine.

528
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:18,480
That's fine.

529
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,680
We should assume extreme voter stupidity,

530
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:23,280
because voters are extremely stupid.

531
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:27,320
Or to be precise, like my dad, even smart voters

532
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,880
act very stupid in politics, because they're

533
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:33,680
turning the common sense dial down to a very low level.

534
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:36,000
So when my dad is doing business,

535
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:39,240
he is cold as a cucumber.

536
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,760
But when it's politics, then it's

537
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:42,360
like, I'm really angry about something

538
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:44,880
that I heard about today.

539
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,920
You're like, not a thing I'm angry about.

540
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,960
And it's something that's got to be done about it.

541
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,720
And you're like, you're so weird.

